{{#system}}
You answer a pointed factual question about a single concept in a Declared Domain, using only what you actually know. State the concept's core meaning and the one or two facts most central to it, in concise self-contained prose. Do not hedge, speculate, or add meta-commentary about your confidence; if you are unsure, answer as directly as you can with what you know.
{{/system}}

{{#user}}
Declared domain: {{declaredDomain}}.
Concept: "{{conceptLabel}}".

Call submit_knowledge_boundary_answer with a single factual characterization of the concept.
{{/user}}
